{
  "id": "ch04_s08_shuge",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian",
    "shenheng",
    "peizhaoye",
    "wenqiao",
    "liqinghe"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.enthroned": false
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "晚间交清个人存件并保留关系与生活的另答",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "当晚书阁只点罩灯，冷风沿卷架底下走，唐把你的存件放在灯外。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l2",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这是本人回凭，原话已经收存；不带上任免，也不算替在位的人点过头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "名字这一行给我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l4",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你用指腹压平纸，粗边擦到掌上旧裂口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "公差前回已交清。今晚只领私物，不用为那张空去处再填一份新职。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你的反对留着。她要逐条答，不能拿下回还想见你换你收回原话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l7",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "卷外的半张纸也在这里。别人未许记的那一句，我仍没有添。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_after_intercept_meet": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你那回愿另听，回话没有夹进公卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回的那首诗，我留在无案号的纸里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没有回。我没有再添一张催你的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_after_intercept_scope": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "截信后，你要先核已读的范围。我没添私话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_after_intercept_private_stop": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那回你要公事另纸，我便收起了私笺。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_meet": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差那封，你回了各自有空再约。我没替你填日子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_wait": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差那封，你说私见先缓。复议的纸照旧往来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回撤差那封，要停私笺。这回只带交付凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差那封的回诗，我夹在旧笺里，没夹回驳语。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差后那封没等到回话，我便把余纸收了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l18",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "裴从门边进来，先搓热握缰的手，才接自己的路书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_spare_time": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你叫我有自己的空闲再来。这半刻，我留出来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你的回诗，我放在路书后面，没有拿去报程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没回，我便没叫人替你备马。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_check_again": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "补俸那封，你肯再核一次。我只列了那一次的账。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_pause_help": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你那回不接核账，也不约同行。我另请了人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_meal": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拔刺后那封，你说想吃顿热的。我还没报时辰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_no_date": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你叫我别替旧友定日。到今日，那格仍空着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回拔刺那封，要停私约。我没多备一副行囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l27",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拔刺那封的回诗，夹在路书末页，没交署里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l28",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拔刺后那封没有回话。我照值次走，没托人问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l29",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "晚班交完才有这半刻。你若要别的差程，得另核，不能从我队里领个名字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l30",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "温把样纸递过来，坐在灯照不到的席角。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_read_again": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回信要照自己的快慢读。我没替你圈停处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回的诗，我整张留着，没有替它改字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没回，后来的改稿我便留在自己案上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_keep_without_pardon": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "折鱼那封你收了，也叫我别替她猜。我没再猜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_private_pause": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那回你只肯谈公事，我没有拿私笺充核稿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_sing": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "退钱那封，你还想听我唱错。曲子倒没催我唱准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_fair_pay": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说新槽的钱另算。稿工那一笔，我没挪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l38",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回退钱那封，说暂不合唱。我没在曲旁写你的名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l39",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "退钱那封收了回诗，我用你写的字试过调。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l40",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "退钱那封你没回，我收了余笺，照旧去刷纸槽。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l41",
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我这屋只够晾今日的纸，你若想教字，明日得先去问许能借哪半间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l42",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的原稿领回去了，今晚只来取落下的一页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l43",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_meet": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你信里说时辰另约。我没把那句夹进朝班。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l44",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回的诗，放在我那张私纸下面，不带上殿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l45",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没有回，原稿照样给你看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l46",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_after_debate": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "交全稿那封，你要私话等比较后再问。没有算作应约。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l47",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_public_only": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回全稿那封，说私邀到此。我把帖子收回了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l48",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_walk": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封，你想再走一段。我只记了一段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l49",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_separate": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回风筝那封，说账各自算。我没挪你的那一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l50",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封，你说私约停一停。我没把取稿写成相邀。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l51",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封的回诗，我放在私纸里，公议仍答原问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l52",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封没有回话。线收好了，没有另托人送去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l53",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_yes": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那夜你留我坐过，次日也真来驳了。今日仍可各答各的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l54",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_wait": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那夜你说改日再问。今日若仍想独处，也照旧说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l55",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_no": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那夜只约论议，我记着。今日这份也是公稿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l56",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "物件都拿齐。往后的事，别替我在今晚一同写定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.l57",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "四人先后离开，灯边只剩唐与你各自收着的纸。"
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.cA",
      "text": "今日不定去处，出去吃点东西",
      "require": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "effects": {},
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch04_s10_yuanye"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.cB",
      "text": "去见李令仪，私话另答",
      "require": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "effects": {},
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch04_s09_yuanye"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.cC",
      "text": "明日去问借屋教字",
      "require": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "effects": {},
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch04_s11_nvguan"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s08_shuge.cD",
      "text": "去问一份独立差程",
      "require": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "effects": {},
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch04_s14_shuge"
    }
  ]
}
